xt","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/animation(_:body:)":{"abstract":[],"title":"animation(_:body:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/animation(_:body:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"animation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"V","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Animation","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9AnimationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlaceholderContentView","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI22PlaceholderContentViewV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"s